            "review_title": "Review at 33 Cafe",
            "review_text": "Winkie Lee\nHong Kong, China40 contributions\n0\nUnforgettable Avocado Coffee\nJul 2019 • Couples\nThe coffee here is extraordinary! Try the avocado coffee, it tastes like a thick smoothie that I promise it won't disappoint you! Good for the taste and the soul!\n\nAlso tried the Phin Coffee, aka drip coffee, a strong black coffee with a tiny bit of saltiness. Taste like nothing that I have tried before! Definitely give it a go if you are open to trying new things. Wouldn't recommend to anyone who are not good with strong coffee and people who are extremely thirsty right now cause you will to wait for at least 5 to 10 minutes to let the coffee \"drip\".\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 1, 2019",
